# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Scene viewmodel (test/README.md): the first-person weapon at several view
# angles. hl1-start's intro to the start corridor, impulse 101, then the
# crowbar (impulse 1) and the MP5 (impulse 3) each shot level, looking up
# and down, and turned left / right: the view model rides with the view
# (HLSDK cl_dll/view.cpp V_CalcGunAngle, the model at the eye with the view
# angles), so every shot of one weapon frames it the same. Last, the MP5
# held against the corridor's north wall (y 776: the 16 u hull + 1 u off
# it), level and looking 30 down at it: the view model draws in front of
# the world (GoldSrc's view model depth range), never into the wall.
startmap hldemo1
waitmap hldemo1 600
waitnear -2048 744 36 48 60
impulse 101
wait 1
impulse 1
wait 2
look 0 270
wait 0.5
shot crowbar-level
look -70 270
wait 0.5
shot crowbar-up
look 70 270
wait 0.5
shot crowbar-down
look 0 225
wait 0.5
shot crowbar-left
look -45 315
wait 0.5
shot crowbar-upright
impulse 3
wait 2
look 0 270
wait 0.5
shot mp5-level
look -70 270
wait 0.5
shot mp5-up
look 70 270
wait 0.5
shot mp5-down
look 45 315
wait 0.5
shot mp5-downright
setpos -2048 759 36 0 90
wait 0.5
shot mp5-wall
look 30 90
wait 0.5
shot mp5-wall-down
pass
